      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その記章は、グランシェルトの騎士か。\r\nいつも助かってるよ。\r\nどの子でも、好きなのを連れていきな。",
        "official_en": "That insignia tells me you’re a knight of Grandshelt. Your service has me in your debt. Please, take any that you’d like.",
        "real_en": "That insignia... You're a Grandshelt knight. You knights are always helping us out. Take whichever chocobo you like."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
